  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Disaster Assistance Response Teams (DART)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds the standby capability of Queensland Fire and Emergency Services (QFES) and Fire and Rescue NSW (FRNSW) for preparedness to deploy as Disaster Assistance Response Teams (DART), including to undertake urban search and rescue activities, following international crises. Funding under this investment also supports teams to undertake capacity building activities with ODA eligible counterparts in the Asia-Pacific region for strengthened local disaster preparedness and response.</narrative>
  </description>
